      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max has heard that Vika loves him, and he goes straight to his best friend Kostya. The two of them talk it through behind the bar. Max isn't sure whether to be happy or frightened. Listen for the names and the numbers.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
